flowchart LR
    P[Parent] -->|sign-in| AG
    T[Teen] -->|sign-in| AG
    K[Child] -->|sign-in| AG
    X[Unknown caller] -.->|refused| AG
    subgraph Boris["TrustBoris"]
      AG[Agent Gateway<br/>caller identity · MCP tool gating · agent throttle] --> A[Family Buyer Agent]
      A --> LG[LLM Gateway<br/>prompt/reply screening · response cache · backup model · model throttle]
    end
    A -->|search_products · get_product_offers ·<br/>get_product_price_history| I[(idealo MCP<br/>read-only · trial 500 calls/day)]
    A -->|check_budget · place_order · request_approval ·<br/>approve_request · set_budget · list_orders| W[(Family Wallet MCP<br/>Python + SQLite)]
    W --> R{personal cap OK?<br/>family cap OK?<br/>approval needed?}
    R -->|yes| O[Order recorded + shop deep link]
    R -->|approval needed| Q[Approval request to parent]
    R -->|cap exceeded| N[Refused with reason]
